# Governed Markdown line-ending hygiene (C1-a).
#
# Governed artifacts under knowledge/ are stored and checked out with LF line
# terminators, so the working-tree copy is byte-identical to the committed blob.
#
# Ratification digests and octet counts are computed over the LF form. With
# core.autocrlf enabled and no attribute pinning these paths, a CRLF working
# copy diverges silently from the value a Ratification Ledger entry attests to
# while git status still reports clean.
#
# Required as a separate pre-application condition by NEXUS-RAT-2026-08-02-001.

knowledge/**/*.md text eol=lf
